  "description": "Chelvor is a stylish ligature serif font that blends timeless elegance with modern sophistication. Designed with refined high-contrast letterforms, graceful curves, distinctive ligatures, and elegant alternates, Chelvor creates a luxurious visual experience that instantly elevates any design. Its unique character makes it an excellent choice for designers seeking typography that feels both artistic and premium.\nPerfect for luxury branding, fashion editorials, logos, beauty and cosmetic packaging, perfume labels, wedding invitations, magazines, book covers, social media, boutique businesses, and premium marketing materials. Whether you’re crafting a sophisticated brand identity or an eye-catching editorial layout, Chelvor delivers exceptional style with effortless readability.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Chelvor is a stylish ligature serif font that blends timeless elegance with modern sophistication. Designed with refined high-contrast letterforms, graceful curves, distinctive ligatures, and elegant alternates, Chelvor creates a luxurious visual experience that instantly elevates any design. Its unique character makes it an excellent choice for designers seeking typography that feels both artistic and premium.</p>\n<p>Perfect for luxury branding, fashion editorials, logos, beauty and cosmetic packaging, perfume labels, wedding invitations, magazines, book covers, social media, boutique businesses, and premium marketing materials. Whether you’re crafting a sophisticated brand identity or an eye-catching editorial layout, Chelvor delivers exceptional style with effortless readability.</p>",
